{"reviewId": "290969638_84bBzlfUK", "review": {"abstract": "2014年中期之后，我们有一个切身的感受，当房地产作为一类资产的投资价值渐渐淡去之后，中国庞大的货币面临着方向的选择，我们当时就", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "原来大佬们2014年就判断房价要下跌。\n我的同龄人几乎都是在这之后的5年内买的房，回头一看，确实是在顶点接盘。\n买房的初衷，是结婚需要，这个需求与其说是刚需，不如说是来自于传统观念的压力。\n然后我又想到我认识的一个年长的朋友，19年将名下的房子全部清空……\n选择和认知真的比努力重要得多。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "author": {"userVid": 290969638, "name": "ooo111ooo", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0005-2P7ic6uWgtVvwNG5HEWJwf9/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "ooo111ooo", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}, "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "666-730", "createTime": 1761466525, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "290969638_84bBzlfUK", "userVid": 290969638, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1761466543, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 44, "likes": [{"userVid": 274357337, "name": "🦏犀牛", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0011-K3JCCFTZZT_97PyUnO0r3f9/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "🦏犀牛", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "好读书 不求甚解", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}], "commentsCount": 6, "hotComments": [{"content